---
const year=new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="garden-footer"><div><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/" class="footer-brand">煦意<span>一座慢慢生长的数字花园。</span></a><div class="footer-links"><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/columns/old-notes/">往日手记</a><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/games/">游乐场</a><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/ai/">AI 实验室</a><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/wall/">留言墙</a><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></div></div><p>© {year} XuYi <span>保持好奇，也允许自己慢慢来。</span><a data-astro-reload={Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/games")} href="#top">回到顶部 ↑</a></p></footer>
<style>.garden-footer{max-width:1180px;margin:60px auto 0;border-top:1px solid var(--garden-line,#e3e5dc);padding:32px 0 24px;font-size:10px;color:var(--garden-muted,#858a7a)}.garden-footer>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;align-items:center}.footer-brand{color:var(--garden-ink,#243c30);font:16px SimSun,serif;text-decoration:none}.footer-brand span{display:block;font:10px sans-serif;color:var(--garden-muted,#858a7a);margin-top:10px}.footer-links{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.garden-footer a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.garden-footer p{display:flex;gap:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--garden-line,#e3e5dc);margin:27px 0 0;padding-top:17px;font-size:9px}.garden-footer p a{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:1280px){.garden-footer{margin-left:5vw;margin-right:5vw}}@media(max-width:640px){.garden-footer{margin-top:40px;margin-left:20px;margin-right:20px}.garden-footer>div{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.footer-links{gap:17px}.garden-footer p span{display:none}}
</style>
